  "description": "The RATT CF2 allows you to go anywhere, fast. Equipped with a Shimano GRX RX400 groupset, RONDO Lit wheels with supple 47 millimeter-wide Vittoria Terreno Zero tyres, and an ergonomic Selle San Marco SHORTFIT saddle on a shock-absorbing carbon frame, it’s a modern feat of engineering. While wide tires create unreal traction, the increased fork rake creates low trail geometry for razor-sharp steering – a match made in heaven for boundless riders. Transitions from smooth pavement to broken side roads, and gravel paths to forest tracks are a breeze, with the RONDO Flare handlebar offering additional comfort and control. The RATT features our unique TwinTip Carbon fork that allows you to change your riding position and character of the bike to suit your preferences and the terrain you plan to ride. The RATT CF2’s capability will ignite a spirit of adventure in even the most seasoned cyclists.",
